OL,3,AChris Brown being sentenced over 2023
OL,4,ALondon nightclub attack - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS singer Chris Brown is being
OL,7,Fsentenced over an incident at a
OL,8,Fnightclub in Mayfair, London in 2023 -
OL,9,Fwatch the judge's remarks live above
OL,11,FBrown, 37, pleaded guilty in July to a
OL,12,Fcharge of affray - what is 'affray'?
OL,14,FThe victim, music producer Abe Diaw,
OL,15,Fneeded hospital treatment for head and
OL,16,Fknee injuries, with CCTV showing Brown
OL,17,Fhitting Diaw on the head with a glass
OL,18,Fbottle
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
