OL,3,AChris Brown being sentenced over 2023
OL,4,ALondon nightclub attack - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn court, before sentencing,
OL,7,Fprosecutors described the bottle as
OL,8,Fbeing "heavy" and "square shaped". The
OL,9,Fdefence said this was an "ugly and
OL,10,Funattractive incident", adding it "was
OL,11,Fvery short-lived"
OL,13,FBrown's vocal coach, 40-year-old
OL,14,FOmololu Akinlolu, a rapper from
OL,15,FFlorida, also pleaded guilty to affray
OL,16,F- he will be sentenced today too
OL,18,FA group of Brown's fans are at court,
OL,19,Fwith one telling our reporter: "I want
OL,20,Fto be here to support Chris. It is part
OL,21,Fof history"
